=== SURVEY ===
AlertStudioPage.tsx contained @ts-nocheck/eslint suppression, PageHeader without PageContainer, one raw input, multiple raw buttons, static title/subtitle/placeholder props, hardcoded user-facing labels, and an inline external-channel fallback instead of a stable EmptyState panel.

=== REASONING ===
Kept the change inside the allowed AlertStudioPage.tsx target because the page could be typed directly without backend/API type changes. Replaced the unsafe severity/channel/template handling with typed helpers, kept rule and template search behavior, preserved editor create/update/delete/test flows, and used shared UI primitives for controls.

=== CHANGES ===
Removed type suppressions, added useTranslation and PageContainer, converted raw controls to Input/Button or non-control typed row containers, wrapped visible strings in notifications.alertStudio i18n keys, normalized severity typing, cloned template condition trees without JSON.parse, switched notification channels to the typed kind field, and rendered external channels inside a stable GlassPanel with EmptyState fallback.
